{"id":"ff58133a4b24edeb","group":"20","path":"20/20-lem-compatible-cross-search.md","title":"无限偏函数条件下的共同输出搜索","display":"lem-compatible-cross-search — 无限偏函数条件下的共同输出搜索","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-lem-compatible-cross-search","aliases":["20-lem-compatible-cross-search"],"display":"lem-compatible-cross-search — 无限偏函数条件下的共同输出搜索","chapter":"6","section":"6.5","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 6.5.3 证明中 (6.19) 失败的分支","source_printed_pages":[143,144],"source_pdf_pages":[177,178],"depends_on":["[[20-df-partial-compatibility]]","[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","[[20-df-tred]]","[[20-df-strings]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-lem-compatible-cross-search"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-lem-compatible-cross-search</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-compatible-cross-search — 无限偏函数条件下的共同输出搜索"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 6.5.3 证明中 (6.19) 失败的分支"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>143</span><span>144</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>177</span><span>178</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8cea21e174a04417\" href=\"?note=8cea21e174a04417\" title=\"20-df-partial-compatibility\">20-df-partial-compatibility</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(Z\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta,\\psi:\\omega\\rightharpoonup2\">\\(\\theta,\\psi:\\omega\\rightharpoonup2\\)</span> 的定义域可由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 判定，已定义值可由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 计算；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\sqsubseteq\\chi_B\">\\(\\theta\\sqsubseteq\\chi_B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\\sqsubseteq\\chi_C\">\\(\\psi\\sqsubseteq\\chi_C\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f=\\Phi_e^B=\\Phi_i^C\">\\(f=\\Phi_e^B=\\Phi_i^C\\)</span> 为全函数。不存在与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta,\\psi\">\\(\\theta,\\psi\\)</span> 分别相容的有限串 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho,\\tau\">\\(\\rho,\\tau\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^\\rho(x)\\downarrow\\ne\\Phi_i^\\tau(x)\\downarrow\">\\(\\Phi_e^\\rho(x)\\downarrow\\ne\\Phi_i^\\tau(x)\\downarrow\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8cea21e174a04417\" href=\"?note=8cea21e174a04417\" title=\"20-df-partial-compatibility\">20-df-partial-compatibility</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}compatible\\text{-}cross\\text{-}search}\\vdash\nf\\le_TZ.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}compatible\\text{-}cross\\text{-}search}\\vdash\nf\\le_TZ.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 搜索与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> 相容的有限串 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> 上第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 个程序的第一个停止输出。相容性可由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 判定，因为只有有限个需要检查的共同定义位。真实 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的某个停止前缀提供见证，搜索必结束。真实 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 的停止前缀与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span> 相容，其输出是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x)\">\\(f(x)\\)</span>；无交叉不同条件迫使搜索所得输出与之相等。因此不需计算完整 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,C\">\\(B,C\\)</span> 就可用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 算出共同全函数。定义域可判定的条件使有限相容检查有效，不能只假设一个任意的 oracle-c.e. 偏函数图。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 6.5.3 证明中 (6.19) 失败的分支；印刷页 143, 144；PDF 第 177, 178 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-partial-compatibility","status":"resolved","id":"8cea21e174a04417","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pa